  "body": "Sunrise over Manly and sunset over Stanmore Bay. Warm, welcoming and beautifully presented, this modern home brings together everything we love about life on the Hibiscus Coast. Light-filled interiors, relaxed contemporary style and plenty of space for family and friends make this a home that's easy to love.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms include two generous ensuites, one with an amazing walk-in robe, complemented by a family bathroom and relaxed open-plan living that flows effortlessly outdoors. Whether it's a busy family gathering, a long weekend with friends or simply putting your feet up, there's room to enjoy it all.\r\n\r\nAnd when it comes to outdoor living, there's plenty to get excited about. Enjoy sheltered alfresco entertaining, a private rear garden with a generous lawn, a deck ready for your hot tub and a dedicated fire-pit area for those cooler coastal evenings. Then head to the sunset deck and watch the sky light up over Stanmore Bay. It's a pretty special way to finish the day.\r\n\r\nWith beach walkways nearby, generous garaging and room for the boat and all your beach essentials, weekends are sorted. The upcoming completion of the Penlink motorway connection will add even more convenience for commuting and connecting to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a beautiful home. It's a lifestyle you'll want to make your own. Morning swims. Beach walks. Long summer evenings. Spectacular sunrises and sunsets.",
